  "method": {
    "procedure": "git archive e940a53 features lib tsconfig.json package.json into an isolated temporary directory, symlink the same installed node_modules, bundle baseline and working spacecraft-model.ts with esbuild, instantiate createSpacecraft(THREE,{layout}) for wide and compact using identical otherwise-default options. Call update(0,\"home\",true,{reading:false,delta:0}); traverse the model and the projects-assembly; inventory all Mesh/InstancedMesh objects and separately effectively-visible meshes. Deduplicate geometry objects, materials and underlying typed-array byte intervals. Dispose model resources and remove the temporary directory afterwards.",
    "scope": "Scene graph inventory only. No frustum/occlusion culling, renderer passes, timing or runtime allocation measurement. No DOM/canvas API in the fixture, so screen label texture painting is omitted in both versions.",
    "vertexDefinitions": "uniqueGeometryVertices sums position.count once per unique geometry. instancedVertexInventory sums position.count × instance count for every mesh; triangles similarly use index.count or position.count divided by 3 × instances.",
    "storageDefinition": "uniqueGeometryArrayBytes unions byte spans over backing ArrayBuffers for all attributes, morph attributes and index arrays of unique geometries in the scope. Includes hidden interaction geometry in allMeshes; excludes instance transforms/colors (reported separately), object overhead, textures, render targets and GPU copies.",
    "drawDefinition": "materialDrawSlotsBeforeCulling is one slot per mesh material (or matching geometry group for material arrays), multiplied by zero only for zero-count instances. It is a static upper-bound inventory for one pass, not measured render calls; transparent passes, shadows, AO and WebGL batching can differ.",
    "sharing": "Projects scope and whole scene share geometries/materials; their storage totals are not additive."
  },
